    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 3,
        "sourceEnd": 44,
        "text": "Hi Lin, how do you get to work every day?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "4d3d294b2ccf35b89c649904b9dba833619d7b09c212633e4dad61efd22cbb96",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 49,
        "sourceEnd": 119,
        "text": "I usually take the bus. It's cheaper than the subway, but it's slower.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "2f1a6a58e013c31da5483763d00f68ec7b27286e4b3e076d1a9993ce421c4de3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 124,
        "sourceEnd": 146,
        "text": "How long does it take?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "44b2c28d82caefdf97bb0aea09c5acb8c7330ed13e641a68603b46c6cac1dae9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 151,
        "sourceEnd": 227,
        "text": "About 40 minutes. The subway takes only 25 minutes, but it's more expensive.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c59105c4ffcf31bd47a151eb0c29ebbe6e593efb55cf6256280d58aca601c9e6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 232,
        "sourceEnd": 256,
        "text": "Do you ever ride a bike?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "47d7357722dc2586e7218352bcdc1317238ae6d26575e623c6a990aa90a1c059",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 261,
        "sourceEnd": 362,
        "text": "Sometimes, when the weather is nice. The bike ride is the fastest way, but it's also the most tiring.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "09577a36fd1923faffcd4ea74040038c44fde47b093048f567df53ceea3eb999",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 367,
        "sourceEnd": 403,
        "text": "I see. How often do you take a taxi?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "eb400ad50577a8d70b7a74bcb4c6fcae241704f656f86cb45cce9d0012ebefcc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 408,
        "sourceEnd": 506,
        "text": "Very rarely. Taxis are the most expensive option. I take one maybe once a month, usually at night.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "5e8f5f390c1589b58bdb8a78c0e9b313405224fe5d3cd506a6bc3fe1eb8d88af",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 511,
        "sourceEnd": 532,
        "text": "What about the train?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "8f3aae526f0ebace7137aeb39b4bd1e66e47263f52dff90bc2aa92edb4aba346",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 537,
        "sourceEnd": 673,
        "text": "Oh, I forgot to mention the train. The train is faster than the bus but slower than the subway. It's also more comfortable than the bus.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "b9341da0724d41bba4390b1634434666d8ee8b82bc814605aa38f80745b3765f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 678,
        "sourceEnd": 712,
        "text": "So, which is the best way for you?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "9ceb9379f5a831ae9e1ef2eb4511bb504b09717df8f2a24ee9c4af60dfb1b63d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 717,
        "sourceEnd": 853,
        "text": "For me, the bus is the best because it's cheap and I can read on it. But on rainy days, the subway is better because it's more reliable.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f9a6134cb37df178b788c18e429df5b9a78308237ba61f21e27aff6cc7bb9e5c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 858,
        "sourceEnd": 885,
        "text": "How do you pay for the bus?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "82956ba3c6c86a5861543b19955ca44a3df26d99f16802262d50b07eb99fa4a8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 890,
        "sourceEnd": 967,
        "text": "I use a transport card. You can buy one at the station. It's very convenient.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "6c61dd48bc1315d80bf192a964a6718d970ca7936f627831cd64385066de5ed6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 972,
        "sourceEnd": 999,
        "text": "Thanks for the information.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "ecf50e8a8a365706cd6aa4414d7dc8ea78847ddd8d1cb4fa6a2444d867a428f3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1004,
        "sourceEnd": 1114,
        "text": "You're welcome. By the way, the bus comes every 10 minutes during rush hour, but every 20 minutes after 8 p.m.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "4c1b88d724d3fae96ccaa75be20e16c57b9e1cfa896189f3c8a8b853163895fa",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
